The only other way of permanently getting rid of regenerating
creatures that I have found is to sacrifice them.  If you
partially eat it, it will still 'rise from the dead' and I
don't believe the partially eaten state affects its hit points.
If you're carrying it around (or your pet is) it will still
spring back to life.

